        "title": "fix: pin repair review bases and renew post-flight credentials",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- capture one immutable target-base SHA at contributor-repair start\n- pass that pinned base through edit, validation, Codex review, validation-fix, and review-fix iterations\n- retain one deterministic live-main sync immediately before push\n- mint and use a fresh target GitHub App token for post-flight reads and publication\n- add acceptance coverage for both cited failure modes\n\n## Validation\n\n- `pnpm run check`\n- exact-head ClawSweeper review after the final branch push\n\nCloses https://github.com/openclaw/clawsweeper/issues/493\n\nRequested and reproduced by @Takhoffman; this carries forward the evidence from the two run fixtures cited in the issue.\n",
